Monetary Policy
For Fed Funds futures-implied policy expectations, the standard Bloomberg approach is to query the front-month and deferred Fed Funds futures contracts (FF1 Comdty, FF2 Comdty, etc.) or use the OIS curve (YCSW0042 Index) for market-implied rate paths. The WIRP  function on the Terminal provides meeting-by-meeting implied probabilities.
